{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vextorial</strong> is an award-winning Multi-Dimensional puzzle-platformer where you play as <strong>Pilo</strong>, a 2D creature exploring a 3D space. Solve unique mind-bending puzzles by shifting gravity around you to explore an ancient ruin and uncover the mystery of your lost memories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Throughout the adventure you will:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate GRAVITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615090/extras/gifgameplay-1-gif.gif?t=1743291584\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate across planes of a 3D cube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615090/extras/Shorter_Cool_gif.gif?t=1743291584\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Meta-Puzzles in hub areas to progress through the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615090/extras/gifgameplay-5-gif.gif?t=1743291584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the lore of the enigmatic realm (Not main focus in Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615090/extras/gifgameplay-2-gif.gif?t=1743291584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>About The Demo</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes a selection of 15 levels with 3 additional mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main game consists of 6-7 ad